        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP-5050C, Silicone Bulb Fire and Smoke Door Seal</b>\r\n<p>\r\nPerimeter door seal kit, self-adhesive silicone gasket. Edge sealing system - Category \"G\" for 20 minute rated category B wood doors. \r\n<br>Smoke and draft control - Category \"H\" up to 3 hours Hollow Metal doors and up to 90 minutes Wood fire doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nField sizable, cut to fit. Easy installation - Door frame must be clean and free of debris. After cleaning just peel the protective film from the self-adhesive glue tape and stick to the door frame. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP 5050C Door Seal\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Color: Dark Charcoal</li>\r\n<li>Material: Silicone</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/5050C_cutsheet.pdf?v=1704262415\" target=\"new\"><b>NGP 5050C Cutsheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 3 lengths:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>17 Feet: for 3'0 x 7'0 doors</li>\r\n<li>21 Feet: for 4'0 x 8'0 doors</li>\r\n<li>25 Feet: for 8'0 x 8'0 pair of doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
